<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-NOK raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NOK raised.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Research Institute of Securities and Economics Inc said it upgraded NOK Corp to a &quot;1&quot; from its previious &quot;2&quot;.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;1&quot; ratingg to issues whose values it expects will outperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 110 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
